        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Vacation Scheduling – The number of employees in each classification at each location who may be scheduled for vacations during any given workweek shall be determined by the Company. Such determination shall be made consistent with the workload and the Company's obligation to maintain a proper working force in each activity and to provide adequate service to its customers. The Company shall make a reasonable effort to provide",
